<section id="federation-limits" class="paper-section">
  <div class="container paper-shell">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <span class="section-kicker">Research motivation</span>
      <h2>Challenges in federated PKI environments.</h2>
      <p>
        Existing mechanisms for establishing trust across PKI domains, such as cross-certification and bridge CAs, among others, have enabled interoperability for years. However, as trust topologies become denser and cryptographic transitions more demanding, path discovery, trust governance, and route selection remain difficult to reason about in a formal, deterministic, and crypto-aware way.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="limits-grid">
      <article class="limit-card">
        <div class="limit-card-chart" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 260 132" class="limit-card-chart-svg">
