            <text x="226" y="126" text-anchor="end" class="limit-card-axis-label">
              Federation links
            </text>
            <text
              x="18"
              y="70"
              text-anchor="middle"
              dominant-baseline="middle"
              class="limit-card-axis-label"
              transform="rotate(-90 18 70)"
            >
              Candidate paths
            </text>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Growing complexity of trust topologies</h3>
        <p>
          As trust relationships expand across multiple domains, PKI ecosystems evolve into highly interconnected trust topologies where the number of admissible certification paths grows rapidly, increasing the difficulty of path discovery, governance, and explainable route selection.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="limit-card">
        <div class="limit-card-chart" aria-hidden="true">
